Package: openplay
Title: Open Men's Soccer Event Data with Expected Goals
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Noah", "Bair", email = "noahlbair@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Downloads and reads an open repository of men's soccer event data
    (every pass, shot and tackle with pitch coordinates) for the big five European
    leagues, UEFA club competitions and major international tournaments from
    2014/15 onward, with an expected goals value on every shot. Files are
    downloaded once from a 'GitHub' release, checked against published checksums
    and cached. Includes season and career summaries and player lookup by full
    name with spelling suggestions.
